{
  "category": "Compressed Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Compressing the energy from its internal core lets it fire off an attack capable of blowing away a mountain.",
      "version": "black"
    },
    {
      "text": "The solar energy absorbed by its body’s orange crystals is magnified internally and fired from its mouth.",
      "version": "white"
    },
    {
      "text": "The solar rays it absorbs are processed in its energy core and fired as a ball of light.",
      "version": "black-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "The solar rays it absorbs are processed in its energy core and fired as a ball of light.",
      "version": "white-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "The solar rays it absorbs are processed in its energy core and fired as a ball of light.",
      "version": "x"
    },
    {
      "text": "Compressing the energy from its internal core lets it fire off an attack capable of blowing away a mountain.",
      "version": "y"
    },
    {
      "text": "The solar rays it absorbs are processed in its energy core and fired as a ball of light.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "Compressing the energy from its internal core lets it fire off an attack capable of blowing away a mountain.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "The blasts of energy it makes from sunbeams have terrifying power. However, it’s not able to fire its blasts at night or on rainy days.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Known for its hefty horsepower, this Pokémon is a popular partner for construction workers.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "When it fires off energy with all its might, the power creates countless fissures on its body.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "It absorbs rays of sunlight and shoots out energy. It’s usually lurking deep beneath the surface.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "This hardy Pokémon can often be found on construction sites and in mines, working alongside people and Copperajah.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "Although its energy blasts can blow away a dump truck, they have a limitation— they can only be fired when the sun is out.",
      "version": "shield"
    }
  ],
